    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to a house that will deliver on location, potential and space. This detached 215 sq m home which is just 400 m from Ardee`s main street is convenient to all local amenities, as well as being beside frequent bus routes to Dundalk, Drogheda and Dublin. \n\nThis house, which sits on a large enclosed site, has off street parking to front and side, as well as a garden room for additional storage. \nThe house itself has recently undergone substantial refurbishment works, which were brought to 2nd stage. Thus the property presents the rare opportunity for its future owner to make their own decisions around key factors including carpentry, sanitary ware, electrical finishings. \n\nThe present layout and accommodation also present enormous opportunity for a bespoke approach to the next owner or occupant. A very important factor is that this is a future-proofed home, thanks to the downstairs bathroom, so our description of each area is quite adaptable. \n\nGround floor: \n•Entrance hall with bathroom \n•Living room with bedroom and home office adjacent \n•Second living room with French door onto side patio / parking \n•Guest wc \n•Kitchen-diner with large window overlooking large south facing back garden \n•Sunroom also overlooking terrace and back garden \nUpstairs: \n•Bedroom 1 a double with built in wardrobe \n•Bathroom \n•Bedrooms 2 & 3 (singles) \n•Bedroom 4 the principle bedroom with ensuite and French doors onto a roof terrace (incomplete) \n\nThis property is both unusual and remarkable in its context and potential. It is now on the market and is priced to reflect that some works are required. However given the extent of works already completed, its next owner will be able to complete and bring the property to full function very quickly. \n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Notice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
